Usage: ruralz node dump [FLAGS]

Save /config/dump, secrets omitted.

Flags:
  --admin URL              Admin base URL of the Node (default http://127.0.0.1:9901)
  --admin-token-file PATH  Operator admin token file
  --ca-file PATH           Extra trust anchors (PEM)
  --client-cert PATH       Client certificate for admin mTLS
  --client-key PATH        Key of --client-cert
  --help                   Print this help
  --output-file PATH       Write the document to PATH instead of stdout
